# collisional_starburst_recipe with R2's flags (SFprescription 1), an instability burst
# (mode 1, a constructed unstable gas fraction of 0.1) of a real R2 central into its
# instability channel: the commits' hydrogen caps (S:1131-1135, S:1169-1173) and then the
# burst's hydrogen refresh (M:798-803), which overwrites the row's H1gas with the atomic
# remainder ColdGas * 0.74 - H2gas of the cold gas the burst leaves.
# Source: R2 reference /Volumes/Internal/results/sage26-campaign/workspace/e01-reference/out/R2/model_0.hdf5 (SHA-256 c6af6c9385d41adcccbd5f19e064323486706b0965183f61ebded290331f6714), Snap_63 row 14849 (GalaxyIndex 3000165000000000, Type 0).
# End-of-snapshot output values used as plausible call inputs, not reconstructed call-time
# state (the writer stores these fields verbatim; DiskScaleRadius is the output's DiskRadius).
# Constructed: SnapNum (the row's snapshot less one), deltaMvir (+2% of Mvir), MergTime 999.9
# (SAGE26's central clock, B:288), OutflowRate 0 (its value after the first-occupied reset,
# R/src/core_build_model.c:276), TimeOfLast*Merger -1 (SAGE26's creation sentinel; unread)
# and zero histories; call.time, call.dt and call.step are the R1 template's plausible values.
# Reachability: R2-reachable.
